dish"}},{"languageCode":"yo","languageName":{"simpleText":"Yoruba"}},{"languageCode":"zu","languageName":{"simpleText":"Zulu"}}],"defaultAudioTrackIndex":17}},"videoDetails":{"videoId":"1bQpx7MNO7Y","title":"Is the FPL BlackBox Patreon Worth It? Every Perk Explained","lengthSeconds":"494","keywords":["fpl","fantasy football","football","GW","#FPL","#Fantasyfootball","Fantasy Premier League","#FantasyPremierLeague"],"channelId":"UCGJ8-xqhOLwyJNuPMsVoQWQ","isOwnerViewing":false,"shortDescription":"👉 Join the FPL BlackBox: patreon.com/fplblackbox\n\nIn this video, I'm walking you through everything you get as an FPL BlackBox Patreon member — the tools, the competitions, and the community that make up the membership.\n\n🟢 WhatsApp Group – join Mark Sutherns, Luke, Andy, Az and an active group of FPL managers for daily discussion, banter and insight.\n\n🟢 Tools to help your season – FPL Stats, TransferLab and Team Ratings, all built to help you make sharper decisions week to week.\n\n🟢 Competitions with physical prizes – FPL League, Predictions League, Goalscorer Challenge and Survivor, all with real trophies and bragging rights on the line.\n\nIf you're serious about your FPL season this year, this is everything you need in one place.\n\n----------------------------------------------\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1bQpx7MNO7Y/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEiCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ==\u0026rs=AOn4CLDSdItzuMDHMJgMDucb5wguP6r_qA","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1bQpx7MNO7Y/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEiCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ==\u0026rs=AOn4CLDN_jwkQrk4cMRk9EYdStjuKQ8SRg","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1bQpx7MNO7Y/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEjCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE=\u0026rs=AOn4CLAuP_5J6r3O98dx6rDhoyYqHANWWA","width":246,"height":138},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1bQpx7MNO7Y/hqd